ase tracking-wider\">Product Expertise</h3>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n<span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-body-sm text-body-sm rounded-md border border-outline-variant\">KMS Core</span>\n<span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-body-sm text-body-sm rounded-md border border-outline-variant\">Auth Service</span>\n<span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-body-sm text-body-sm rounded-md border border-outline-variant\">API Gateway</span>\n<span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm rounded-md border border-outline-variant border-dashed\">+3 more</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Recent Activity Feed -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-xl p-lg\">\n<h2 class=\"font-h3 text-h3 text-on-surface mb-6\">Recent Activity</h2>\n<div class=\"relative before:absolute before:inset-0 before:ml-4 before:-translate-x-px md:before:mx-auto md:before:translate-x-0 before:h-full before:w-0.5 before:bg-gradient-to-b before:from-transparent before:via-outline-variant before:to-transparent\">\n<!-- Activity Item 1 -->\n<div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group is-active pb-8\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-surface bg-primary text-on-primary shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 ml-0 md:ml-0 z-10 relative\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">edit_document</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-[calc(100%-3rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] p-4 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary\">Article Updated</span>\n<time class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-outline\">2 hours ago</time>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md font-medium mb-1\">Updated 'Troubleshooting AWS RDS Connections'</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm\">Added section covering IAM authentication errors and updated connection string examples for production environments.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Activity Item 2 -->\n<div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group pb-8\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-surface bg-surface-container-highest text-secondary shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 ml-0 md:ml-0 z-10 relative\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">check_circle</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-[calc(100%-3rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] p-4 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary\">Ticket Resolved</span>\n<time class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-outline\">Yesterday</time>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md font-medium mb-1\">TKT-8942: High latency on API Gateway</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 mt-2\">\n<span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-error-container text-on-error-container font-label-md text-label-md rounded text-[10px]\">P1 - Critical</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Activity Item 3 -->\n<div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-surface bg-surface-container-highest text-secondary shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 ml-0 md:ml-0 z-10 relative\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">forum</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-[calc(100%-3rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] p-4 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary\">Commented</span>\n<time class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-outline\">Oct 24</time>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md font-medium mb-1\">On 'Proposed changes to caching strategy'</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm border-l-2 border-outline-variant pl-3 mt-2 italic\">\n                                    \"I recommend we stagger the invalidation process during off-peak hours to avoid the thundering herd problem we saw last quarter.\"\n                                </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6 text-center\">\n<button class=\"text-primary font-label-md text-label-md hover:underline\">View all activity</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>\n<script>\n        // Generate a mock contribution graph\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            const graphContainer = document.getElementById('contribution-graph');\n            const cols = 52; // roughly a year of weeks\n            const rows = 7; // days in a week\n            \n            for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) {\n                const colDiv = document.createElement('div');\n                colDiv.className = 'flex flex-col gap-1';\n                \n                for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++) {\n                    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n                    cell.className = 'w-3 h-3 rounded-sm border transition-colors hover:border-on-surface';\n                    \n                    // Randomize intensity heavily weighted towards lower activity to look realistic\n                    const rand = Math.random();\n                    let intensity = 0;\n                    if (rand > 0.95) intensity = 4;\n                    else if (rand > 0.85) intensity = 3;\n                    else if (rand > 0.6) intensity = 2;\n                    else if (rand > 0.4) intensity = 1;\n\n                    cell.classList.add(`contrib-${intensity}`);\n                    \n                    if (intensity === 0) {\n                        cell.classList.add('border-outline-variant', 'border-opacity-30');\n                    } else if (intensity === 1 || intensity === 2) {\n                        cell.classList.add('border-primary-fixed-dim', 'border-opacity-50');\n                    } else {\n                        cell.classList.add('border-transparent');\n                    }\n\n                    // Optional: Add tooltip logic here if needed\n                    colDiv.appendChild(cell);\n                }\n                graphContainer.appendChild(colDiv);\n            }\n        });\n    </script>" }}
    />
  );
}
